{"strongs": "H2864", "word": "חָתַר", "translit": "cha.tar", "root": "חתן", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb", "gloss": "dig, row", "definition": "חָתַר verb dig, row (Late Hebrew id., bore (through), so Aramaic חֲתַר ᵑ7 (rare)) — Qal Perfect ׳ ח Job 24:16 , חָתַרְתִּי Ezek 12:7 Imperfect וָאֶחְתֹּר Ezek 8:8 , יַחְתְּרוּ Ezek 12:12 ; Amos 9:2 , וַיַּחְתְּרוּ Jonah 1:13 Imperative חֲתָרֿ Ezek 8:8 ; Ezek 12:5 — 1. dig into houses, with accusative בָּתִּים Job 24:16 (of burglary); followed by בְּ into or through a wall Ezek 8:8 (twice in verse) ( Co strike out on internal grounds), Ezek 12:5 ; Ezek 12:7 ; Ezek 12:12 metaphor followed by בשׁאול Amos 9:2 dig into She'ôl , i.e. as a refuge. 2. row (as digging into the water) Jonah 1:13 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3263')\">BDB3263</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2864')\">H2864</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3262')\">BDB3262</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3264')\">BDB3264</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>חָתַר</bdbheb> <b>verb</b> <highlightword>dig, row</highlightword> (Late Hebrew <highlight>id., bore</highlight> (through), so Aramaic <bdbarc>חֲתַר</bdbarc> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> (rare)) — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Perfect</highlight> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ח</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,16)\">Job 24:16</ref>, <bdbheb>חָתַרְתִּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,7)\">Ezek 12:7</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> <bdbheb>וָאֶחְתֹּר</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,8)\">Ezek 8:8</ref>, <bdbheb>יַחְתְּרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,12)\">Ezek 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 9:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,2)\">Amos 9:2</ref>, <bdbheb>וַיַּחְתְּרוּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jonah 1:13\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(32,1,13)\">Jonah 1:13</ref> <highlight>Imperative</highlight> <bdbheb>חֲתָרֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,8)\">Ezek 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,5)\">Ezek 12:5</ref> — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>dig into</highlight> houses, with accusative <bdbheb>בָּתִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Job 24:16\" b=\"18\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(18,24,16)\">Job 24:16</ref> (of burglary); followed by <bdbheb>בְּ</bdbheb> into or through a wall <ref ref=\"Ezek 8:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,8,8)\">Ezek 8:8</ref> (twice in verse) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Co')\">Co</lookup> strike out on internal grounds), <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:5\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,5)\">Ezek 12:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,7)\">Ezek 12:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,12)\">Ezek 12:12</ref> metaphor followed by <bdbheb>בשׁאול</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Amos 9:2\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(30,9,2)\">Amos 9:2</ref> <highlight>dig into She'ôl</highlight>, i.e. as a refuge. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>row</highlight> (as <highlight>digging</highlight> into the water) <ref ref=\"Jonah 1:13\" b=\"32\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(32,1,13)\">Jonah 1:13</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Job 24:16", "boo